  // Resolve penetration
  if (ball.vy > 0) ball.y = brick.y - ball.r; else ball.y = brick.y + brick.h + ball.r;
}
```
Actually, the "pushing the ball back out" part is important to prevent the ball from getting stuck inside the brick if the frame rate is low or the speed is high.

