If `overlapX < overlapY`:
  If `ball.x < brick.x + brick.w / 2`, the ball hit the left side, so it should be at `brick.x - ball.r` and `ball.vx` should be negative.
  If `ball.x > brick.x + brick.w / 2`, the ball hit the right side, so it should be at `brick.x + brick.w + ball.r` and `ball.vx` should be positive.

